            <ArticleTitle>20-year follow-up of a patient with coronary artery spasm.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1010-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors present a 20-year follow-up of a patient with well-documented coronary artery spasm, who initially presented with syncope. The patient had excellent response to calcium channel antagonists and long-acting nitrates.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
